# Source files allowed over the {{ agentic_max_file_tokens }}-token cap
# (or, for bash, the code-line limit), one per line, each with the
# ticket that will bring it back under:
#
#     path/to/big_file.py  # owner/repo#123
#
# An entry without a ticket is refused, and an entry whose file came
# back under every cap that applies to it — or disappeared — has to
# leave the list. The hook is scripts/check_file_length.py.
